            "review_item_state": "Des Plaines, IL",
            "review_item_content": "My friend from Ft. Lauderdale introduced me to SPORTea® while on a visit to her home last year. The minute I tasted it... I knew I was hooked.   I LOVE the flavor.  I play a ton of tennis all year long..and find that SPORTea® is the only thing I crave while playing. I also make sure I pack it for my ski trips every year out west....but I also just drink it around the house too. I am not exagerating... I love your product, it is a one-of-a-kind, sustaining, energizing beverage.",
