            "review_item_state": "Cary, NC",
            "review_item_content": "I enjoyed the flavor and energy I got from drinking it. My husband and I were (and still are) very active. We felt SPORTea® gave us a healthy alternative to water every so often. I was so glad to be able to order the product online. We continue to enjoy the many benefits of SPORTea® and now our girls enjoy it also.",
